{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前TVB小花陳芷尤（Apple，現名陳思帆）自2019年離巢後返回新加坡發展，前年3月宣布結婚，同年誕下大仔，組成幸福家庭。今年5月陳芷尤宣布懷上第二胎喜訊，但今年9月自爆因突然穿羊水，於懷孕32周時緊急剖腹早產誕下細女，由於囡囡早產且體重偏輕，出生後隨即被送入新生兒加護病房（NICU）及暖箱留醫觀察。經歷近兩個月的悉心照料，日前陳芷尤終於宣布好消息，細女順利出院返屋企！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳芷尤（現名陳思帆）在2024年3月突然宣布婚訊。（IG@xoxoapo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250926/1048256285021179904170492.jpeg/qC6m-rECgiAjMfHCH1foq8YDzqhnEsyvC15aZQteWmU\"/><figcaption>陳芷尤（現名陳思帆）在2024年3月突然宣布婚訊。（IG@xoxoapo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好恩愛！（IG@xoxoapo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250926/1048256287726637056235981.jpeg/hpt0qfuCvsARRZXKXoBfwYPuQe3o4vLTgzTbKIM02yg\"/><figcaption>好恩愛！（IG@xoxoapo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同年誕下兒子「小龍果」，一家三口幸福美滿。（IG@xoxoapo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260923/1179437198412484608723816.jpeg/D5B1R2IUlzrz1tO3StcHakY278WHPJGlZpoWamaaFmo\"/><figcaption>同年誕下兒子「小龍果」，一家三口幸福美滿。（IG@xoxoapo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"由於女兒屬於早產兒且體重偏輕，出生後需留於新生兒加護病房（NICU）及暖箱內接受觀察。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181632105336016896134296.jpeg/vPnNVGuj1HvM6yT3xRUTn_wxNkaHsNr3d2S3m3dkt5s\"/><figcaption>由於女兒屬於早產兒且體重偏輕，出生後需留於新生兒加護病房（NICU）及暖箱內接受觀察。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"早產出世。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186725065505378304267984.jpeg/Y5IdlwNkpJ2nDrk5YDuiV85KzxcLkGbh4027JuNNuyY\"/><figcaption>早產出世。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"產後近3周迎首次「袋鼠式護理」。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186725068022091776684793.jpeg/oW2P4aEbDqTd0U_WBPmF_klKvXFMruD037F-mt-xfpo\"/><figcaption>產後近3周迎首次「袋鼠式護理」。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>陳芷尤早產囡囡留醫近兩個月終出院　獲頒「畢業證書」：我的小戰士</p><p>陳芷尤在IG限時動態分享抱着囡囡出院的溫馨合照，並寫道：「Today was supposed to be my baby girl's due date. But she decided to arrive 2 months early. And today she's coming out again. Not from my tummy, but from..（今天原本是我寶貝女兒的預產期，但她決定提早兩個月出生，今天她又再次『出來』了。不是從我的肚子，而是從……）」相中戴著口罩的陳芷尤抱着囡囡，並大曬醫院新生兒科頒發的「畢業證書」，紀念囡囡成功跨過難關「畢業」出院！她感性發文表示：「From 1.15kg to 2.6kg. Almost 2 months in the hospital, and today, you're finally coming HOME! So many mixed emotions right now.🥹You've come such a long way, my little fighter. Now it's time to come home and be showered with all the love you deserve!🩷（從1.15公斤增至2.6公斤，在醫院住了差不多兩個月，今天你終於回家了！現在百感交集，你已經走了很長一段路，我的小戰士，現在是時候回家，接受你應得的所有愛了！）」</p><figure><img alt=\"陳芷尤早產囡囡留醫近兩個月終出院。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199382422794407936931846.jpeg/3R_IyHQzZmoIsox4iLzplc9vk10utsMtdaOcLnWjnC4\"/><figcaption>陳芷尤早產囡囡留醫近兩個月終出院。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳芷尤早產囡囡留醫近兩個月終出院。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199382420378357760403967.jpeg/O6HCtcn6szVuqndb1Av7iThvmvs3ibWlRZxoB0WcaAc\"/><figcaption>陳芷尤早產囡囡留醫近兩個月終出院。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"健康長大！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199385901407408128806153.png/GSwJKrOtdZT6-DNgoRUPdPz7Y44uMxAo2kGhmNpBoZg\"/><figcaption>健康長大！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"母愛偉大！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199382449625763840123059.jpeg/XJly48XBnT7yTb8XUN_j4766NQO_QZcYISHpUyEh6VM\"/><figcaption>母愛偉大！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>回顧NICU陪女辛酸史　日日泵奶母愛偉大</p><p>此外，陳芷尤亦曾上載短片回顧過去近兩個月作為「NICU/SCU寶寶媽媽」的點滴，片中所見，早產出世的Rozelle身形極其嬌小，身上插著喉管躺在醫院暖箱內，陳芷尤隔着玻璃窗伸手入內輕撫愛女小手，眼神滿是心痛與溫柔。為了讓留醫的女兒獲得充足營養，陳芷尤每日定時泵奶、儲滿一袋袋母乳送到醫院。如今見證愛女健康長大並順利回家團聚，不少網民及圈中好友紛紛留言送上祝福，大讚兩母女都非常堅強！</p><figure><img alt=\"囡囡早產。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199382447230685184143759.jpeg/sIgHZdm4q1h3AmighyE_shetIjFgeXmxmfkZm5n5GZs\"/><figcaption>囡囡早產。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"心痛。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199382444260986880628431.png/RcLAUmlkOkm4zYDnO5MK-_MywzVdvzw3VKrQj1Sq0I8\"/><figcaption>心痛。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"努力泵奶！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181632110080036864802796.jpeg/q9QI0VatAK2bZh0fzYckP34FPsFKLxSWuPRrMLj0azA\"/><figcaption>努力泵奶！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"態度樂觀！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199382441488420864340769.png/UrapqP5RTNfg7XeAl8jZ5ppK2aLY771Zc69DcHOvQ3A\"/><figcaption>態度樂觀！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"努力泵奶！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199382439009456128298540.png/JTJN3NAH-E5bQooWOUln4sqoSCvsXflkdZz1YXWc9WE\"/><figcaption>努力泵奶！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:26:03.618156+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1368,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:00:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:11:00.386817+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:19:32.951627+00:00","content_hash":"55b6ff3995c17b15136cac92610232d948028f9ece157ecc821344b541f5a0b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}